      "text": "GET /suggest?q=ap&limit=5\n→ 200 OK (< 50ms)\n[\"apple\", \"application\", \"app\", \"april\", \"apartment\"]\n\nFrequency update (async, batched):\nKafka topic: search_clicks\n{query: \"apple\", clicked: true, position: 0, ts: 1714982400}\n\nTrie rebuild (nightly, 30min batch):\nSELECT query, count(*) FROM search_log\nWHERE ts > NOW() - INTERVAL '1 day'\nGROUP BY query ORDER BY count DESC LIMIT 10M",
      "fontSize": 14,
